  "notes": "A verb expressing contempt or condescension toward others.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive)\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦{人|ひと}→人：00476_hito⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{見下|みくだ}す (to look down on people)\n- {見下|みくだ}すような⟦{態度|たいど}→態度：03396_taido⟧ (condescending attitude)\n- {見下|みくだ}した⟦{目|め}→目：00525_me⟧⟦で→で：00502_de⟧⟦{見|み}る→見る：00283_miru⟧ (to look at with disdain)\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- ⟦{見下|みお}ろす→見下ろす：04569_miorosu⟧: to look down from above (physical)\n- ⟦{軽蔑|けいべつ}→軽蔑：04849_keibetsu⟧⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧: to despise\n- ⟦{蔑|さげす}む→蔑む：10024_sagesumu⟧: to scorn",
